  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InteractiveObject
  title: "Gi\u1EA5y khen"
  description: "N\u0103m n\xE0o h\u1ECDc xong, m\u1EB9 c\u0169ng ch\u1EDF m\xECnh
    ra ti\u1EC7m in g\u1EA7n tr\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u1EC3 \xE9p plastic t\u1EA5m
    gi\u1EA5y khen m\u1EDBi. R\u1ED3i m\u1EB9 mua m\u1ED9t c\xE1i khung m\u1EDBi
    th\u1EADt \u0111\u1EB9p. B\u1EE9c t\u01B0\u1EDDng trong ph\xF2ng gi\u1EDD to\xE0n
    gi\u1EA5y khen. C\xF3 c\xE1i m\xE9p \u0111\xE3 cong, c\xF3 c\xE1i ch\u1EEF b\u1ECB
    m\u1EDD v\u1ECB bay m\u1EF1c. Nh\u01B0ng m\u1EB9 v\u1EABn lau t\u1EEBng c\xE1i,
    c\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA3o: \u201CM\u1ED1t con l\u1EDBn, nh\xECn l\u1EA1i cho vui.\u201D"
  url: https://app.arit.live/HF1DpTGb2WmRT0SB
  qrCode: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 649d8be56227c8742ae6dfe6a0cd963a, type: 3}
  MainCamera: {fileID: 0}
