  description: "Con nh\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ta c\xF3 xe \u0111i\u1EC7n, c\xF2n m\u1EB9
    ch\u1EC9 mua \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c con nai nh\xFAn \u0111\u1ECF, m\u1EAFt to tr\xF2n
    long lanh, th\xE2n n\xF3 \u0111\u1EA7y hoa. M\u1EB9 n\xF3i \u201Cnh\xFAn c\u0169ng
    \u0111i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\xE0\u201D. Th\u1EBF l\xE0 em nh\xFAn th\u1EADt,
    kh\u1EAFp nh\xE0, t\u1EEB ph\xF2ng kh\xE1ch ra t\u1EDBi c\u1EEDa. L\xFAc \u0111\xF3
    ch\u1EB3ng th\u1EA5y thi\u1EBFu g\xEC h\u1EBFt, ch\u1EC9 th\u1EA5y vui, v\xEC
    c\xF3 ba m\u1EB9, c\xF3 con nai nh\xFAn ch\u1EDD s\u1EB5n trong g\xF3c."
