  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InteractiveObject
  title: CON YOYO
  description: "M\xECnh m\xEA con yoyo l\u1EAFm, th\u1EA5y m\u1EA5y anh l\u1EDBn
    ch\u01A1i quay t\xEDt nh\xECn m\xE0 \u0111\xE3. M\xECnh xin ba mua cho m\u1ED9t
    c\xE1i m\xE0u \u0111\u1ECF. Ng\xE0y \u0111\u1EA7u ch\u01A1i, m\xECnh qu\u0103ng
    m\u1EA1nh qu\xE1, n\xF3 \u0111\u1EADp xu\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1EA5t k\xEAu \u201Cc\u1ED9p\u201D
    m\u1ED9t c\xE1i r\u1ED3i b\u1ECB m\u1EBB 1 g\xF3c lu\xF4n T_T. Chi\u1EC1u n\xE0o
    m\xECnh c\u0169ng ra s\xE2n, qu\u0103ng l\xEAn, k\xE9o xu\u1ED1ng, l\xFAc \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    l\xFAc r\u1ED1i d\xE2y. C\xF3 h\xF4m quay tr\xFAng \u0111\xE0, yoyo ch\u1EA1y
    tr\xF2n t\xEDt m\u1ED9t v\xF2ng r\u1ED3i b\u1EADt ng\u01B0\u1EE3c l\xEAn tay,
    m\xECnh th\u1EA5y m\xECnh nh\u01B0 l\xE0 \u201Ccao th\u1EE7 yoyo\u201D z\u1EADy
    \u0111\xF3 hihi!"
