  title: "Truy\u1EC7n \u0110\xF4 R\xEA Mon"
  description: "M\u1EB9 mua cho em cu\u1ED1n \u0110\xF4-r\xEA-mon \u1EDF nh\xE0 s\xE1ch
    c\u0169, gi\xE1 n\u0103m ngh\xECn \u0111\u1ED3ng. M\u1EB9 n\xF3i may m\u1EAFn
    l\u1EAFm m\u1EDBi th\u1EA5y cu\u1ED1n c\xF2n m\u1EDBi nh\u01B0 v\u1EADy. Em th\xEDch
    \u0110\xF4-r\xEA-mon l\u1EAFm, n\xEAn l\xFAc m\u1EB9 \u0111\u01B0a truy\u1EC7n,
    em \xF4m c\u1EA3 ng\xE0y \u0111\u1ECDc mi\u1EBFt, m\xE2n m\xEA t\u1EEBng trang
    c\xF3 ch\xFA m\xE8o m\xE1y th\xF4ng minh, c\u1EE9 ngh\u0129 ch\u1EAFc \u0110\xF4-r\xEA-mon
    bi\u1EBFt m\u1EB9 th\u01B0\u01A1ng em n\xEAn m\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EB9 t\xECm
    th\u1EA5y. "
