  title: "K\u1EB8O C CON V\u1ECAT"
  description: "M\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n m\xECnh b\u1EC7nh, m\u1EB9 l\u1EA1i d\u1EAFt ra
    ti\u1EC7m thu\u1ED1c. M\u1EB9 mua thu\u1ED1c, c\xF2n m\xECnh th\xEC c\u1EE9 nh\xF5ng
    nh\u1EBDo \u0111\xF2i m\u1EB9 mua th\xEAm h\u1ED9p k\u1EB9o con v\u1ECBt m\xE0u
    v\xE0ng. M\xECnh h\u1EE9a s\u1EBD u\u1ED1ng thu\u1ED1c ngoan, \u0111\u1EC3 mau
    h\u1EBFt b\u1EC7nh. L\u1EA7n n\xE0o c\u0169ng v\u1EADy, v\u1EC1 t\u1EDBi nh\xE0
    l\xE0 m\xECnh  v\u1EEBa u\u1ED1ng thu\u1ED1c v\u1EEBa \xF4m h\u1ED9p k\u1EB9o
    m\u1EDBi, h\xED h\u1EEDng \u0111em ra khoe v\u1EDBi t\u1EE5i b\u1EA1n trong x\xF3m.
    Ai c\u0169ng bu l\u1EA1i xin \u0103n chung, c\xF2n m\xECnh th\xEC l\xE0m ra v\u1EBB
    \u201Co\xE1ch x\xE0 l\xE1ch\u201D l\u1EAFm!!!"
